  storyText: "Aldecaldos Camp\n\nTrucks in a circle, a fire, kids, dogs. A scout named Teo raises his rifle. \"City folk don't come out here for fun. What do you want?\"\n\n1. Tell the truth.\n2. Lie: \"Just passing through.\""
